        <span class="text-small text-quiet">防波堤の先に立つ白い灯台を訪ねる．</span>
      </span>
    </span>
  </span>
  <span class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <span class="grid content-start gap-2">
      <span class="font-stretch-84% text-folio leading-none tracking-folio text-quiet uppercase">Mobile — 縮小</span>
