        </span>
      </span>
    </span>
    <span class="grid content-start gap-2">
      <span class="font-stretch-84% text-folio leading-none tracking-folio text-quiet uppercase">Mobile — 縦組み</span>
      <span class="block h-112 border border-rule bg-paper p-6">
        <span class="grid h-full content-start gap-4 [writing-mode:vertical-rl]">
          <span class="flex justify-between pb-2 font-stretch-84% text-folio leading-none tracking-folio text-quiet uppercase [border-block-end:var(--border-width-rule)_solid_var(--color-line)]"><span>No. 07</span><span>Travel</span></span>
          <span class="text-5xl leading-tight font-strong"><span class="block">週末は</span><span class="block">灯台のある港町へ</span></span>
